  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1299494979751304}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 210
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 这奇遇还得从我炼气期时说起。{$TmpTalkString}应该知道，宗门藏经阁内的地阶秘籍，是只对筑基期以上的弟子才开放的。
